Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1789934399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789862399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 90's 2771 high with a close 255.7 lower is a buy-climax bar, and the 29 bars since then overlap inside the range rather than trending - trading-range behavior after a climax.", "No close has exceeded 2771; the recent highs 2680 (bar 111) and 2700 (bar 119) are below the spike high, so the range top has already rejected the bulls.", "Bar 115 fell from 2517.53 to 2358.62 in a single bar, showing fast two-sided movement inside the range and poor trend persistence.", "The final bar closed 67.02 below its own 2700 high, so there is no acceptance yet at the upper boundary; the bull push is an in-range leg, not a confirmed breakout.", "The 2357.18 and 2358.62 lows are roughly equal, which marks a range floor that has been tested twice and can break rather than hold."], "evidence_for": ["Net window change is upward (open 2066.43 to close 2632.98) and the post-crash lows rose: 1368.42 (bar 14), 1512.91 (bar 34), 1803.74 (bar 55), 1821.49 (bar 72), 2357.18 (bar 102).", "Bar 88 broke out of a roughly 27-bar consolidation with a 377.29-point range (1905.63-2293.8) closing at 2252.16, and bars 89-90 followed through to 2771, satisfying the breakout-plus-follow-through test.", "Price holds well above the breakout: the last close 2632.98 is about 38% above bar 88's 1905.63 low and has not returned to bar 89's 2111 low.", "The most recent leg is bull: four consecutive higher closes off the 2358.62 double-bottom retest, and bar 119's 2632.98 is the highest close in the supplied window.", "The post-spike range has held above the spike bar's 2325.31 low and keeps making higher swing lows inside the range (2357.18 then 2358.62 with a higher close)."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars, open_time 1779494400000 to 1789776000000, with the decision at the close of the final bar (close_time 1789862399999).", "Window high is 2771 (bar 90, open_time 1787270400000); window low is 1368.42 (bar 14, open_time 1780704000000).", "Bars 10-14 (1780358400000-1780704000000) are five overlapping bear bars driving 2006.17 down to 1368.42; bar 14 closes 1568.55, about 200 points above its low, a sell-climax tail.", "Bar 88 (1787097600000) opens 1916.51 inside the prior consolidation and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.8 high; bars 89-90 close 2326.32 and 2515.3, and bar 90 prints 2771 and closes 255.7 below that high.", "Bars 91-119 overlap between 2357.18 (bar 102 low, 1788307200000) and 2700 (bar 119 high); bar 90's low of 2325.31 was never revisited.", "Roughly equal lows at 2357.18 (bar 102) and 2358.62 (bar 115, 1789430400000) form a double bottom at the range low, followed by four higher closes (2416.57, 2446.22, 2612.02, 2632.98).", "The final bar's close 2632.98 is the highest close in the whole window, while its high 2700 stays 71 below bar 90's 2771 high; the last bar closes 67.02 under its own high."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg into a sell climax: bars 0-14 decline from bar 0's 2143.61 high to bar 14's 1368.42 low; the final bars are large bear trend bars and bar 14 closes 200.13 above its low.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779494400000, "upper_boundary": "2143.61"}, {"description": "Two-sided consolidation (bars 61-87, about 27 bars): upper boundary is bar 65's 1974.46 high with repeated 1919-1938 highs; lower boundary is the triple equal low 1821.69/1821.59/1821.49 (bars 70-72). Bar 88 later opened at 1916.51 inside it before breaking out.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1821.49", "start_time_ms": 1784764800000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Three-bar bull spike (bars 88-90): 1916.51 to 2252.16 to 2326.32 to a 2515.3 close, with bar 90 reaching 2771 and closing 255.7 off the high - a buy-climax bar.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-climax trading range (bars 91-119): upper boundary 2771.00 with internal highs capped at 2557.46, 2537.57, 2680 and 2700; lower boundary 2357.18 (bar 102 low), retested at 2358.62 (bar 115).", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Recent bull leg: four consecutive bull closes from bar 115's 2358.62 low to bar 119's 2700 high; bar 119's close 2632.98 is the highest close of the window.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2771 followed by a bar holding above 2771 would confirm a bull breakout and move the read toward breakout-spike/channel.", "Rejection at 2700-2771 with a bear close back below 2604.75 keeps the range classification and supports rotation back toward the 2400 area.", "A close below 2357.18 would break the range's double bottom and shift the read toward a range breakdown or deeper bear leg.", "A close below 2111 (bar 89 low) or 1905.63 (bar 88 low) would negate the bull breakout structure and make the bear side the structural read.", "Continued overlapping bars closing between roughly 2400 and 2700 would keep phase as range and Always-In relevance low."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789919999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The most recent 22 bars are a clean bull sequence - higher highs 2450.87 to 2700.00 and higher pullback lows 2358.62 to 2495.82 - which on its own is a bull leg, not rotation, and would support a bull-trend label.", "2700.00 exceeded the prior window high 2680.00, and the two spike bars 1789732800000/1789747200000 closed within about 7 points of their highs, evidence of real breakout strength rather than a fade.", "The pullback from 2700.00 stopped at 2568.16, still 72.34 above the 1789732800000 low 2495.82, and the final bar closed at its high 2611.00, so the bull leg's structure has not been broken and always-in stays with the bulls.", "Since 1789128000000 most closes have been above 2500, so price has spent extended time in the upper part of the window rather than rotating back to the 2357-2358 floor."], "evidence_for": ["Three separate pushes above roughly 2530 (2537.57, 2680.00, 2700.00) each closed far below the high of the push (bar 1788523200000 closed 72.26 under 2527.18; 1789128000000 closed 124.48 under 2680.00; 1789804800000 closed 61.51 under 2700.00) with no acceptance.", "The 2609.02 probe (1789416000000) was followed within five bars by two large bear bars into the 2358.62 floor, and the 2700.00 high was followed by three consecutive bear bars, showing both window edges keep being retested rather than broken.", "42 consecutive bars (1788537600000-1789113600000) closed only between 2436.83 and 2523.22, and the floor appears twice at 2357.18 and 2358.62 - persistent two-sided rotation rather than sustained trend.", "Net window progress is limited: first close 2479.66 versus last close 2611.00, while price travelled the full 2357.18-2700.00 width inside the same window."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars from 1788192000000 to 1789905600000 span 2357.18 (low of bar 1788336000000) to 2700.00 (high of bar 1789804800000), 342.82 points (14.5%); first close 2479.66, last close 2611.00.", "Two comparable lows, 2357.18 (1788336000000) and 2358.62 (1789488000000), sit about 72 bars apart and define the floor of the window.", "Bar 1788436800000 is a wide bull bar, open 2407.48 to close 2506.79 (high 2509.15); bar 1788508800000 then printed high 2537.57 and the next bar (1788523200000) reversed to close 2450.96 with low 2436.73.", "Bars 1788537600000-1789113600000 (42 bars) overlap heavily, with closes confined to 2436.83-2523.22 and extremes 2411.04 (1789041600000) to 2528.80 (1788739200000).", "Three upside probes stalled at the top: 2680.00 (1789128000000, close 2555.52, upper tail 124.48), 2609.02 (1789416000000, close 2514.07) and 2700.00 (1789804800000, close 2638.49); none was accepted.", "Bear spike bars 1789473600000 (2484.35 high to 2423.29 close) and 1789488000000 (low 2358.62) ended the 2609.02 probe.", "From the 2358.62 low, 22 bars built higher highs 2450.87, 2481.66, 2495.99, 2519.81, 2585.50, 2643.52, 2700.00 with higher pullback lows 2370.54, 2436.87, 2495.82.", "Bars 1789732800000 and 1789747200000 are consecutive wide bull bars closing 2578.60 and 2636.28, each within about 7 points of its high.", "Bars 1789862400000, 1789876800000 and 1789891200000 are three consecutive bear bars from 2632.98 down to 2577.88 (low 2568.16); the final bar 1789905600000 opened 2577.69 and closed at its own high 2611.00 (range 2571.48-2611.00), retracing about one third of the 131.84-point drop from 2700.00."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Window-wide trading range with low 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000) and high 2700.00 (bar 1789804800000); the 2357-2358 floor was tested twice and the 2537.57 / 2680.00 / 2700.00 tops each gave back at least roughly 95 points, so the full 120-bar span is one wide two-sided range.", "end_time_ms": 1789919999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788192000000, "upper_boundary": "2700.00"}, {"description": "Mid-window 42-bar rotation; closes stayed inside 2436.83-2523.22 and extremes were 2411.04 (1789041600000) and 2528.80 (1788739200000), with repeated failure to hold either edge.", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2528.80"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2700.00 high (1789804800000): a spike at 1789732800000/1789747200000, then smaller overlapping bars 1789761600000-1789848000000, then a 131.84-point pullback to 2568.16 that held above the 1789732800000 low 2495.82.", "end_time_ms": 1789919999999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Oversized upside bars that closed well off their highs near the top of the range: 1789128000000 (2457.12-2680.00, close 2555.52), 1789416000000 (2540.11-2609.02, close 2514.07) and 1789804800000 (2626.53-2700.00, close 2638.49).", "end_time_ms": 1789804800000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": null}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Acceptance above 2700.00 - a close above it with follow-through, ideally two consecutive closes - would shift the read from trading-range toward bull-trend/breakout-spike.", "A close below 2568.16 (the 1789891200000 low) and then below 2495.82 (the 1789732800000 low) would show the top-of-range breakout attempt failed and re-open rotation toward 2436.87 and the 2357.18-2358.62 floor.", "Continued overlapping bars between roughly 2568 and 2700 with no close outside that band keeps the current range/range classification intact.", "A decisive break of 2357.18 would end the window floor and move the classification toward a bear-trend / range breakdown."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2407", "close_time_ms": 1789505999999, "high": "2413.3", "low": "2397.58", "open": "2413.05", "open_tim